<title>FINLAND: SUUNTO SEES WEAKER 1996 EARNINGS.</title>
<headline>SUUNTO SEES WEAKER 1996 EARNINGS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish compass maker Suunto Oy said on Wednesday it expected its full-year 1996 earnings to be weaker than the 1995 level, when it booked a 30.1 million markka profit after financial items.</p>
<p>&quot;The current year's result will be weaker than last year's,&quot; Suunto said in a statement with its January-August results. &quot;However, the final tertial result is expected to be at last year's level,&quot; it said.</p>
</text>
